/Title (Only 38% of Spotify's 761M MAUs convert to Premium. Existing systems decide whether to message, never what to offer or when, and treat all free users identically, even though 47% will never convert and 100% of converters hit a friction wall first. Spotify's own Audiobooks+ proves this exact signal already creates value, found once, by accident, in a single vertical.)
